Design lineage
--------------
The visual language — translucent midnight panels, clipped corners, cyan edge
accents, atmospheric depth, geometric participant marks — was developed in the
Ascent interface by the ExOS project and is carried forward here by its authors.

Typefaces
---------
Chakra Petch and JetBrains Mono are served from Google Fonts under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1. They are not bundled with this repository. If the network is
unavailable the surface falls back to the platform's system fonts.

No third-party JavaScript is included. The background is a single original
WebGL fragment shader. The record store and server use the Node.js standard
library only.
